# `permissions.tool_patterns`

Enumerate tool-pattern capability names (for agent builders).

**Policy** — read (C0, safe). Capability `ship.permissions.read`.

## Arguments

None.

## Returns

`ToolPatternsResponse` (JSON).

| field | type |
|-------|------|
| `patterns` | `map` |

## Invoke

```
ship ops call permissions.tool_patterns --json '{}'
```

Kind: read.

## Example response

```json
{
  "patterns": [
    {
      "pattern": "Bash(cargo *)",
      "label": "cargo commands",
      "source": "builtin"
    },
    {
      "pattern": "Bash(just *)",
      "label": "just commands",
      "source": "builtin"
    },
    {
      "pattern": "Read",
      "label": "file reads",
      "source": "builtin"
    },
    {
      "pattern": "Edit",
      "label": "file edits",
      "source": "builtin"
    }
  ]
}
```
